@inherits LayoutComponentBase

@* Feature 008. A plain shell.

   Everything that used to be here is gone rather than restyled: the theme provider, the Material
   layout, the app bar and its title span, and the IsDarkMode cascade the chart read its palette
   from. The appearance now follows prefers-color-scheme in wwwroot/Theme/broadsheet.css, so there
   is no scheme for C# to know about and nothing to cascade (008 research R3).

   Each page owns its own frame, because the rail is part of the page rather than chrome around it. *@

@Body

<div id="blazor-error-ui" data-nosnippet>
    An unhandled error has occurred.
    <a href="." class="reload">Reload</a>
    <span class="dismiss">🗙</span>
</div>
